ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLiu Xu, Meng Nan, and Bai Haotian are headquarters staff of the company, they are discussing the upcoming spring team activity. Bai Haotian is the person in charge of the activity, he proposes a mountain climbing activity. However, Liu Xu and Meng Nan prefer to go fishing. Liu Xu looks at Meng Nan, gives Bai Haotian a look. Meng Nan shakes his head, seems to have no information. Liu Xu cheers up, looks confident. Bai Haotian chats with other colleagues, does not pay attention to other things.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Meng Nan shake his head?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Meng Nan indicates he is unwilling to persuade Bai Haotian to change the project.\nB. Meng Nan indicates he does not want to participate in the spring team activity.\nC. Meng Nan wants to tell Liu Xu that he is a bit tired.\nD. Meng Nan indicates he cannot see Bai Haotian's activity plan.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0011694691031775984,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e262d6006945d28024e8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368098010,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:58","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"f82b3b9c19d246adac135a2221762a59"}